Package: python3-ml-dtypes
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${python3:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, python3-numpy
Description: NumPy extension dtypes used by TI machine-learning runtimes
 ml_dtypes provides NumPy implementations of several machine-learning data
 types, including bfloat16, float8, and low-bit integer formats.
 .
 This package is compiled for the native Python and NumPy ABI of each suite.
